## ToolResult / ToolResult<T>

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Models`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Core`

### Purpose
Wrapper for function/tool call results with success flag, message, and optional typed result. `ToolResult<T>` implements `ISuppressibleResult` for context size reduction.

### ToolResult
```csharp
public class ToolResult
{
    public ToolResult();
    public ToolResult(bool success, string? message);

    public bool Success { get; set; }
    public string? Message { get; set; }
}
```

### ToolResult<T>
```csharp
public class ToolResult<T> : ToolResult, ISuppressibleResult where T : class
{
    public ToolResult();
    public ToolResult(bool success, string? message) : base(success, message);
    public ToolResult(T result, bool success = true, string? message = null) : base(success, message);

    public T? Result { get; set; }

    public string Suppress()
    {
        if(Result is ISuppressibleResult res)
            return res.Suppress();
        return $"[RESULT: {Success}, MESSAGE:{Message ?? "empty"}";
    }
}
```

### Properties
| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Success` | `bool` | Whether the operation succeeded |
| `Message` | `string?` | Human-readable result message |
| `Result` | `T?` | Typed result data (ToolResult<T> only) |

### Usage
```csharp
// Simple result
return new ToolResult(true, "File created successfully");

// Typed result
return new ToolResult<FileInfo>(fileInfo, true, "File created");

// Suppressible result (reduces context after AI processes it)
var result = new ToolResult<MyData>(data, true, "Operation completed");
// After AI processes: result.Suppress() returns shortened string
```

